(7417845, 1170135, 38032, '<td valign="top">Processing added a bit of halo -  but otherwise a splendid shot. Many of the pano shots lack much feeling of dof but this is an exception.<br/> Some interesting intersections create a discomfort for me (the points on the boats line up with the rocks in the distance) - It also seems to be sharp almost across the board which feels strange. Really a shot to explore and feel ... discomfort.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1167386" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167386.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167386.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167386.png"/></a></td>', 'Processing added a bit of halo -  but otherwise a splendid shot. Many of the pano shots lack much feeling of dof but this is an exception. Some interesting intersections create a discomfort for me (the points on the boats line up with the rocks in the distance) - It also seems to be sharp almost across the board which feels strange. Really a shot to explore and feel ... discomfort.', '2015-11-22 14:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
